[[63,7,2,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the bonnet</p><p>Disconnect the positive battery terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584661\">3330C40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584658\">3330C30</a></p><p>1. Loosen the belt tensioner (1c) and the bolts (1b) fixing the\nalternator (1a).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2022763.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,2,"<p>1. Use wrench (1a) to disconnect brake pipe fittings(1b) from the\nmaster cylinder.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Box wrench for brake fittings</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.856.132.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo both nuts (2a) securing master cylinder (2b) and withdraw\nfrom brake servo (2c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2022764.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,2,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit the master cylinder and secure by\ntightening nuts to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>BRAKE MASTER CYLINDER (PUMP)</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.5 ÷ 0.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the brake line connectors to the\nmaster cylinder using the appropriate wrench.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Box wrench for brake fittings</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.856.132.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Connector</p></td><td><p>RIGID PIPE TO FRONT BRAKES</p></td><td><p>M10 x 1</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584323\">1092B60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584658\">3330C30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584661\">3330C40</a></p><p>Connect the positive battery terminal.</p><p>Close the bonnet lid.</p>"]]